WEBVTT

00:08:30.756 --> 00:08:35.396
It is in the present
and only in the present

00:08:35.436 --> 00:08:39.076
that we can truly nourish our happiness

00:08:39.076 --> 00:08:44.636
and handle and take care of our pain
and our suffering.

00:08:46.476 --> 00:08:50.116
For example, in this moment,

00:08:50.156 --> 00:08:53.876
if each of us takes time
to really breathe in

00:08:53.916 --> 00:08:57.356
and come back to our body,

00:08:57.396 --> 00:08:59.516
we may find tension.